WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.690
Nijino Yume's Aikatsu is about to start!

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.200
My idols.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.950
The day of Winter Fest fast approaches.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.210
This year, we hold it in collaboration with the surrounding town, Kirakira City.{set we not the name over?}{it's fine}

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.960
Here are the rules.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.290
This Fest is a competition—

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:33.680
Flower Song Class, Bird Theater Class, Wind Dance Class, and Moon Beauty Class will face off.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:39.680
Every class will hold various performances in each area of the city.{needs more gerrymandering}{that's racist}

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:43.690
The classes will be voted on by the local townsfolk,

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:46.440
determining the victor in each area.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.560
It is called...

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.320
The Star Captor Festival!

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.490
The Fest begins in one week.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.320
Idols!

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.120
I wish you luck.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.910
A performance competition between the classes.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.410
That sounds fun!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.720
The Star Captor Festival, huh.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.260
It gets me going!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.730
Theater Class will rise to rule the Fest.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.480
The proof lies with the top idol of our class.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.980
We are Four Star Academy's Theater Class.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:01.700
I'll make sure you never forget the sight of our burning actress souls!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.160
Yuzu-senpai's the leader of Dance Class.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.080
You never know what angle she'll attack from.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.920
Heya!{well}

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.420
It's me, Yuzu!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:17.630
I'm coming at you with a hop, skip, and jump! {ﾌﾞｰﾝ ｸﾙﾘﾝｽﾀっと}{uh sure}

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.170
For sure.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:24.300
Don't forget about the crowds that've been entranced by Yozora-senpai of Beauty Class.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:29.140
Beauty flows out from within.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.150
Always strive to improve yourself.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:36.020
Yeah, Onee-chan knows how to bring it home when it really counts.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:40.610
If that's how you're gonna be, Hime-senpai is the undisputed number one!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.910
The spirit urging us on to surpass our limits.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.870
That is what makes us shine ever brighter!

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.620
This is going to be one fierce battle.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.130
I wouldn't be surprised at any outcome.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.130
Objection!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.260
Theater Class is going to win!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.880
You won't take us down that easily!

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:09.140
The encroaching Winter Fest this year
 is the Star Captor Festival.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:15.940
Theater Class is going to aim for total domination!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.780
Our first target is the aquarium area.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.900
Signs point to a quiz show being held here.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.780
Let us devise a plan for certain victory.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.160
Yes!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:32.160
Can we not simply answer the most questions correctly?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:36.040
You have to keep in mind the unique rules the Star Captor Festival has.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.670
Winning the quiz show is one thing,

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:44.050
but to claim the area, you need the crowd's approval of your efforts.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:49.810
In other words, we need to demonstrate that we worked the hardest to win.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.770
As such, we'll use every day we have to prepare for the quiz.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.850
Girls, are you with me?

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.310
Yes!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:03.320
What do you think is the greatest weapon of Beauty Class?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.070
Song Class has singing.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:11.330
Dance Class has dancing and Theater Class has acting, so we can't hope to compete in those.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:16.960
This leaves us holding the crown in beauty, but it isn't that simple.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.590
Idols are like the myriad shining stars in the sky.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.210
There are just as many kinds of beauty.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:29.970
That's why I believe we must plan to put in a little extra oomph to surprise everyone with. {"plus alpha", literally ＋α, is to go just a bit beyond the norm}{I think it's almost always "a little extra oomph" and you can't talk about oomphs like they're countable}

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.970
Um, could you give an example of how?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.060
Yes, I suppose I could give you a hint.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:40.520
You want to do something that will make everyone break into smiles with surprise.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:46.240
I've already thought up what sort of extra oomph to put in for myself.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:53.740
For now, let's focus on capturing the academy area's star with the free performance event.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:02.800
She's been like that for a while now. Is she okay?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.840
Knowing Yuzu-sama, she's been building up an extraordinary idea in her head!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.010
Probably...

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.770
Yahoo! I'm back again!{this time it's well}

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.440
Yuzu-senpai!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.560
Fighting, fighting!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.150
I got it!

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.070
Yes?

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.030
This looks like a dolphin riding a star!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.080
A dolphin riding a star...

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.750
That's what had you stumped?

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.910
I feel so relieved!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.370
Fighting?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.710
This appears to be the most difficult area to claim.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.800
The shopping district area.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:54.310
This area goes to whichever class is able to gather the most customers to their designated shop.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.310
So advertising will be key.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.350
Not only must we grasp our shop's draws,

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:04.820
we must also be sincere in our appeals the reach the hearts of shoppers.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.570
Which shop have we been assigned to support?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.450
Jewel Ice Cream.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.200
Really?!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.330
I'm the campaign girl for Jewel Ice Cream.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.710
They have so many varieties, and they're all delicious!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.830
Hime-senpai.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.960
I just came up with an idea.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:30.760
Why don't we hand out cards with cute pictures and attach balloons to them?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.760
Wow, that does sound cute.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.890
But what should we write on them?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.640
How about we write about our favorite flavors of Jewel Ice Cream?

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.440
Something like this.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.600
I like it!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:48.530
Utilizing the inherent power of words to imbue the cards with our emotions.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.360
Yes, that sounds lovely.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.950
Let's get started right away.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:53.700
Okay.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.370
Oh, but before that!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:08:00.620
What do you think about us all heading over to have some Jewel Ice Cream for ourselves first?{owesn't this e'ermore so?}{I don't remember, I don't think they even had this}

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.500
I want to try it!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.290
I like it!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.130
Great!

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.380
Let's go!

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.050
Oh, Mahiru.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.850
Onee-chan.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.390
Are you cold?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.270
No, I'm fine.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:31.070
After Winter Fest, the S4 Selection will be almost upon us.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.860
How was it when you took part?

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:37.160
I put everything I had into it, of course.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.290
Just like you are now.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:45.330
Don't worry. I'm sure you'll make it.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.250
Yeah.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.840
So what's it like being in S4?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:57.550
Looking back, becoming a member of S4 filled me with confidence and pride.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:04.600
Especially in this past year, I formed tight bonds with Hime, Yuzu, and Tsubasa.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.440
I can look back on our time with satisfaction.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.820
But from here on out, it will be just one part of who I am as an idol.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:16.070
I want to shine brightly on my own merits, as Kasumi Yozora.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:22.330
That's why I want to lead 
Beauty Class to victory in the Fest.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.080
Plus, I don't want to let the other three beat me.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.380
Yeah, I understand you.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.260
I don't want to lose to Yume, Rola, or Ako either.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.220
Let's do our best.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.730
So you're going to put in some extra oomph with your magic tricks, Kokoro.{this her name right? I'm not completely embarrassing myself?}

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.570
I've been honing my skills. What about you?

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.320
I figured I would show off my karate.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.320
Everyone will definitely be shocked!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.990
I can only hope.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:04.500
Hey, what kind of surprise do you think Yozora-senpai's going to put her extra oomph towards?

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:10.000
She said she wasn't telling until the day of.

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.100
It's time!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:34.110
The Star Captor Festival is upon us!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.650
May every class fight to the best of their ability!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.490
Yes!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:42.740
The first battle will take place here at our academy!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.450
It's the free performance competition!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.330
There!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.470
Her magic performance gets me going!{unrelated but I really like it when rpgs have completely absurd categories of magic like "cup magic" alongside normal categories like "fire magic"}

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.890
The kids really seem to love it.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:09.520
Listen, Mahiru. Try shouting "tile chop!" after you finish doing your karate.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.900
Tile chop?

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.770
Just give it a shot.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:18.780
Next up is Kasumi Mahiru from Beauty Class!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.780
Ready!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.050
T-Tile chop!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.210
Tileman!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.260
Carpenter Ranger!

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.800
Tileman!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:47.560
What's Tileman?

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.480
A popular children's show.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.850
I made a guest appearance once.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.440
That gets me going?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:58.070
Now, which class was the best?

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.070
The one to claim the academy area is...

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.200
Beauty Class!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.660
Yes!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.030
We did it!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:07.910
Yeah!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.830
The next event is the quiz show in the aquarium area!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.960
Today's contestants are these idols!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.090
Don't you dare miss one.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.130
Right!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.300
I'm so nervous!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.430
We can do this!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.810
Are you good at quizzes, Kokoro-chan?

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.060
Leave the pop music questions to me!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.480
Yay!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.730
Let's get right to our first question!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:39.360
The tallest mountain in Japan is...

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:40.610
Okay!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.360
Wait!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.240
Huh?

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.110
Mount Fuji!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.990
Huh?!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.700
That was a trap.{I don't think this the same kind}

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.120
You really saved us.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.120
...Mount Fuji. This mountain—{everyone translates the ga as but/however but for quiz questions it's just the standard way things are worded and you wouldn't but/however an equivalent in english}

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:55.420
along with a hawk and what third thing, is said to bring good luck in your first dream of the year?

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.380
Got it!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.630
Eggplant!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.760
Nice one, Tsubasa-senpai!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.840
We need to step it up!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:05.930
Yeah!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.970
On to question two!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.360
And we're done!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:26.360
The class that answered the most questions correctly is...

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.360
Huh? Where's Yuzu-senpai?

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.610
Theater Class!

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:28.700
We did it!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.990
Not yet. The real battle for this area starts now.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.250
We still have to appeal to the crowd.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:53.390
Whoa! What an incredible appeal from Dance Class!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.890
Yuzu-senpai's amazing!

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.270
That gets me going!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.810
This area has been claimed by...

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.610
What a turnabout! Dance Class!{this is probably the only time I would allow gyakuten to be translated as turnabout}

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.530
Why?!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:07.450
We won the battle, but lost the war...

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.490
Next is the beach area.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.500
We will have each class compete in a beach flag race.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.000
I-It's freezing.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.080
We will win at any cost!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.000
Yes!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.000
On your marks.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.510
Get set...

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.480
It's mine!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.480
Tsubasa-senpai!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:48.150
Theater Class has laid claim to the beach area!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:53.370
The fourth area is the shopping district.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:57.080
Each class will need to attract customers to their assigned shop!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.160
Rola-chan!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.210
It's been too long.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.670
President!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.630
Cleaning again?

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:08.130
It's the most important thing in 
my life, second only to ice cream.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.680
Come on, President.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:16.180
Oh, that reminds me. The deluxe sour konbu ice cream you produced has really found a devoted niche.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.430
A niche, huh.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.940
We'll be counting on you today.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.150
Leave it to us!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:25.940
Here.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.940
Please stop by Jewel Ice Cream.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.490
Look, Mommy! There's a letter on this balloon!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.280
Thank you!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.620
It's going well.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.580
Yeah.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:42.500
The other classes have come up with their own tactics too, so we can't let up one bit. {Lily is definitely giving a quote right now, but it's too covered by Rola and OST}{we need superccs}

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.460
Right.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.340
I just came up with something even better!

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.220
Here, this is for you.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.220
Thanks so much!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.850
As expected of Hime-senpai!{}

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.480
This kind of feels like cheating.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.600
And the shopping district area is claimed by...

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.900
Song Class!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.190
Yay!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:14.030
The Star Captor Festival has reached its climax.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:20.120
It is time for the final battle, held between the two highest-ranking classes so far.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.250
The competing classes will be...

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.380
These two!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:32.130
Theater Class and Beauty Class!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:40.390
This will be a one-on-one competition between 
their leaders, Kisaragi Tsubasa and Kasumi Yozora!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:47.520
We didn't make it to the finals...

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.690
It was pretty close, though.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.530
There was only a hair's breadth between all four classes.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.280
Theater and Beauty Class in the finals...

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.030
How exciting.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.540
It certainly is.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.590
Tsubasa-senpai is so cool!

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.180
She's the best!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.350
The sky's not looking so good.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.440
Yeah.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.310
What's the matter?

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.570
Onee-chan.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:35.450
It's just kind of worrisome, what with the moon hidden behind the clouds.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.830
Don't you worry. I've got the perfect surprise in store.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.830
Look forward to it.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.970
The Frozen Queen Coord.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.930
Kasumi Yozora, like a glimmering star.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.870
So pretty...

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.700
Hey, look up there!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.970
A moon for the night sky!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.350
How beautiful!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:34.600
This was the extra oomph she wanted to surprise us with.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.950
You're so far, Onee-chan.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:58.500
That crescent moon was awesome. I wish I could've ridden it.{koe wo koroshite naita // tsunaida te no aida}

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.960
Didn't you get to ride a dolphin?

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.510
I'm glad everyone seemed to enjoy it.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:10.760
And why wouldn't they? It's been too long since I've seen you get serious.

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:13.640
Hey, it's not fair to focus on Yozora-tan!

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:15.680
Praise Yuzu too!

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:17.730
You were great as well, Yuzu.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:20.730
Yeah, especially when you came out on that dolphin.

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:22.190
Right?

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:23.530
What's her name?

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.030
